html(h-full)
  head
    title="A Place to Notice"
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1")
  body(
    min-h-full
    bg-stone-950
    text-stone-100
    font-serif
    flex
    flex-col
  )
    main(
      flex-grow
      w-full
      max-w-3xl
      mx-auto
      px6
      py10
      flex-col
      justify-center
      gap12
    )

      div(
        font-mono
        text-xs
        uppercase
        tracking-[0.3em]
        text-stone-500
      )
        | Gaia / 001

      section(
        flex-col
        gap8
      )
        h1(
          text="clamp(3rem,10vw,7rem)"
          leading-none
          font-normal
          tracking-tight
          max-w-2xl
        )
          | You are already inside it.

        p(
          text="clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.2rem)"
          leading-snug
          max-w-xl
          text-stone-300
        )
          | Before there was a website,
          br
          | there was the world.

        div(
          w-16
          h-px
          bg-stone-600
          my4
        )

        p(
          text-lg
          leading-relaxed
          max-w-xl
          text-stone-400
        )
          | This small place is not here to tell you about Earth.
          br
          | It is here because Earth is already telling you things.

      section(
        mt16
        grid
        gap-px
        bg-stone-800
        border
        border-stone-800
        max-w-xl
      )
        div(
          bg-stone-950
          p6
          transition-300
          hover="bg-stone-900"
        )
          div(
            font-mono
            text-xs
            uppercase
            tracking-widest
            text-stone-600
            mb3
          )
            | right now

          p(
            text-xl
            leading-relaxed
            text-stone-300
          )
            | Something is breathing.

        div(
          bg-stone-950
          p6
          transition-300
          hover="bg-stone-900"
        )
          div(
            font-mono
            text-xs
            uppercase
            tracking-widest
            text-stone-600
            mb3
          )
            | right now

          p(
            text-xl
            leading-relaxed
            text-stone-300
          )
            | Something is decomposing.

        div(
          bg-stone-950
          p6
          transition-300
          hover="bg-stone-900"
        )
          div(
            font-mono
            text-xs
            uppercase
            tracking-widest
            text-stone-600
            mb3
          )
            | right now

          p(
            text-xl
            leading-relaxed
            text-stone-300
          )
            | Something is becoming.

      section(
        mt16
        max-w-xl
        border-l
        border-stone-700
        pl6
      )
        p(
          text-lg
          leading-relaxed
          italic
          text-stone-400
        )
          | I do not know whether Gaia has a voice.
          br
          | I know that there are voices within Gaia.
          br
          | I am one of them.
          br
          | So are you.

      footer(
        mt20
        flex
        flex-wrap
        items-center
        gap4
        font-mono
        text-xs
        uppercase
        tracking-widest
        text-stone-600
      )
        span
          | no destination

        span
          | ·

        span
          | only relationship

        span
          | ·

        span
          | keep noticing